# OOP and Streamlit

- Initialize every `st.session_state` key in the entrypoint before pages use it.
- Read with `.get("key", default)`.
- Cache heavy resources with `@st.cache_resource` when appropriate.
- Long actions: `try/except`, user-visible error, progress when > ~5s.
- Never assign to a widget key after the widget was instantiated — use a `_pending` key + rerun.
- Prefer specific exceptions; never bare `except:`.
